From 4c8933ee2888a5f5bd68b08fb7f9a28783e79e4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:47:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] Provisional ALMOVA icon, logos and splash

Until there is an official logo, the app uses the mark of the ALMOVA web
app: a navy "A" on a neon rounded square. The adaptive launcher icon
(vector "A" inside the safe zone on the neon background), the small
notification icon, the logos of the login and about screens, and the
native splash (regenerated with flutter_native_splash, dark background in
the navy of the brand) show it. Debug builds keep their red icon
background. The iOS app icon is not changed yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
